sequenceDiagram
    actor BA as Business analyst
    participant AI as AI tool<br/>(Claude, Codex or<br/>Antigravity)
    participant Skill as Skills<br/>(the instructions)
    participant MCP as MCP server<br/>(tool: bpmn_build)
    participant Eng as Drawing engine
    BA->>AI: Describe the process<br/>in plain words
    AI->>Skill: Load the BA workflow<br/>and the modelling rules
    Skill-->>AI: Ask only what is missing,<br/>at most five questions
    AI->>BA: A few short questions
    BA->>AI: Answers, or just draw it
    AI->>MCP: bpmn_build with the diagram<br/>description, stage=svg
    MCP->>Eng: Check it is plain data,<br/>lay it out, run the checks
    Eng-->>MCP: SVG plus any errors to fix
    MCP-->>AI: Result
    AI->>BA: Picture for review
    BA->>AI: Add a legal review step
    AI->>MCP: bpmn_build again with<br/>the updated description
    BA->>AI: Looks right, export it
    AI->>MCP: bpmn_build with stage=all
    MCP->>Eng: Make the PNG and the .bpmn,<br/>test the .bpmn in Camunda's viewer
    Eng-->>MCP: Files and a pass or fail
    MCP-->>AI: Files written to bpmn-output
    AI->>BA: .svg and .png for documents,<br/>.bpmn for Camunda,<br/>.spec.json to change it later
